WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.920
New Year's Day is in January.

2
00:00:09.921 --> 00:00:14.508
"Happy New Year!"

3
00:00:14.509 --> 00:00:25.775
Valentine's Day is in February.

4
00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:30.287
"Will you be my valentine?"

5
00:00:30.288 --> 00:00:36.934
St. Patrick's Day is in March.

6
00:00:36.935 --> 00:00:42.584
"Happy St. Patrick's Day!"

7
00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:56.747
April Fool's Day is in April.

8
00:00:56.748 --> 00:01:02.145
"Ha-ha-ha, April fool!"

9
00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:11.278
Mother's Day is in May.

10
00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:16.506
"Mommy, we love you."

11
00:01:16.507 --> 00:01:21.080
Father's Day is in June.

12
00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:26.884
"Daddy, we love you."

13
00:01:26.885 --> 00:01:34.086
The American Independence Day is in July.

14
00:01:34.087 --> 00:01:40.389
"Wow! Fireworks!"

15
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:47.194
My birthday is in August.

16
00:01:47.195 --> 00:01:51.132
"Happy birthday!"

17
00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:57.959
School begins in September.

18
00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:02.514
"Good morning, Mrs. Wood."

19
00:02:02.515 --> 00:02:11.264
Halloween is in October.

20
00:02:11.265 --> 00:02:19.037
"Trick or treat."

21
00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:25.879
Thanksgiving is in November.

22
00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:34.479
"Please pass the turkey."

23
00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:43.134
Christmas is in December.

24
00:02:43.135 --> 00:02:48.963
"Merry Christmas, everyone!"

